-- OPTIONAL, needs Gabe's OK. Flickr CC covers for the blog. wf_place_photo.source has a check constraint (wikimedia, owner, creator),
-- and lib/photoLicense.js only vaults wikimedia with a free license. Run only after both accept 'flickr'.
